{"ID":"20240118151117-qysrbi1","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151117-qysrbi1","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151117-qysrbi1\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151117-ijvw6ah\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122133404-8z7s6iq\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122133404-8z7s6iq\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:28,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:28\u0026#125;","title":"209芜荑","type":"doc","updated":"20240201143910"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151117-ijvw6ah","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151117-ijvw6ah","updated":"20240201143904"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味辛，平，无毒。治五内邪气，散皮肤骨节中淫淫行毒，去三虫，化食，逐寸白，散腹中嗢嗢喘息。生川谷，一名芜菇。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122133404-0tvzjw0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122133404-0tvzjw0"}},{"ID":"20240122133404-umh9he3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122133404-umh9he3"}},{"ID":"20240122133404-8z7s6iq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122133404-8z7s6iq","updated":"20240201143910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个芜荑跟另外一个名称叫芜菇，原药长什么样子，没什么人可以看懂它，所以说我们——但是本草经里面有，我们留在这不删掉，不删除。"}]}]}